      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="56" topLeftY="30" width="848" height="34">
      <content textType="title" fontSize="24" fontFamily="Inter" bold="true" color="rgba(15,36,64,1)" wrap="false" textAlign="left">
        <p>Assemble: the bank's format stays in the bank's corner</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="56" startY="64" endX="904" endY="64">
      <border color="rgb(39, 121, 167)" width="2"/>
    </line>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="56" topLeftY="84" width="532" height="384">
      <fill>
        <fillColor color="rgba(247,249,251,1)"/>
      </fill>
      <border color="rgb(214, 222, 232)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="72" topLeftY="100" width="504" height="352">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="11" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" color="rgba(61,74,92,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.32" textAlign="left">
        <p>BankPaymentRequest bankRequest =</p>
        <p>    BankPaymentRequest.builder()</p>
        <p>      .cardNumber(request.getCardNumber())</p>
        <p>      .expiryMonth(String.format("%02d",</p>
        <p>          request.getExpiryMonth()))</p>
        <p>      .expiryYear(String.valueOf(</p>
        <p>          request.getExpiryYear()))</p>
        <p>      .amount(request.getAmount())</p>
        <p>      .currency(request.getCurrency())</p>
        <p>      .cvv(request.getCvv())</p>
        <p>      .build();</p>
        <p>// MM -&gt; MM/yyyy ; cvv stored as String</p>
        <p>// toString() masks the PAN</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="604" topLeftY="92" width="300" height="250">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(61,74,92,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" textAlign="left">
        <ul>
          <li><p>Anti-Corruption Layer: the bank's wire format lives only in the client package.</p></li>
          <li><p>One converter absorbs the differences - zero-padding, string cvv - in exactly one place.</p></li>
          <li><p>toString() masks the PAN: even a debug log cannot leak card data.</p></li>
          <li><p>Bank contract changes touch one file, not the codebase.</p></li>
        </ul>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="604" topLeftY="360" width="300" height="108">
